<title>JAPAN: Foster Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Foster Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to October 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 22.11		vs	   23.14</p>
<p> Operating	  380    mln	  vs	  397    mln</p>
<p> Current	    581    mln	  vs	  990    mln</p>
<p> Net		  379    mln	  vs	  201    mln</p>
<p> EPS		   15.75 yen	  vs	    8.38 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     24 million	  vs	  24 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Foster Electric Co Ltd is a leader in OEM exports</p>
<p>of speakers and microphones. Company plans to change its</p>
<p>business year to March 31 from April 30.</p>
</text>
